{
  "name": "Pi-hole - Blocklist Sync (weekly, v6 API)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "name": "Sunday 04:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        250,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 4 * * 0"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        490,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "ffbeeec2-067f-4f30-b951-b765b734fc74",
              "name": "piholeUrl",
              "value": "http://10.0.0.226",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a9289144-3ee6-4fef-814d-8c3a03fe84a5",
              "name": "piholePassword",
              "value": "CHANGE_ME_APP_PASSWORD",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "15867c5f-9905-4cbe-a25e-02174943f9dc",
              "name": "blocklists",
              "value": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/StevenBlack/hosts/master/hosts\nhttps://big.oisd.nl",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Pi-hole Login",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        730,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').first().json.piholeUrl }}/api/auth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ password: $('Config').first().json.piholePassword }) }}",
        "options": {
          "allowUnauthorizedCerts": true,
          "timeout": 10000
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Split Lists",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        970,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "return $('Config').first().json.blocklists.split(/\\s+/).filter(Boolean).map(address => ({ json: { address } }));"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Add Blocklist",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1210,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').first().json.piholeUrl }}/api/lists?type=block",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "X-FTL-SID",
              "value": "={{ $('Pi-hole Login').first().json.session.sid }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ address: $json.address, comment: 'managed by n8n', groups: [0], enabled: true }) }}",
        "options": {
          "allowUnauthorizedCerts": true,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": true,
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Summarize",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1450,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const res = $input.all().map(i => i.json.statusCode);\nreturn [{ json: { added: res.filter(s => s >= 200 && s < 300).length,\n                  existing: res.filter(s => s === 400 || s === 409).length,\n                  failed: res.filter(s => !s || (s >= 300 && s !== 400 && s !== 409)).length } }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Run Gravity",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1690,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').first().json.piholeUrl }}/api/action/gravity",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "X-FTL-SID",
              "value": "={{ $('Pi-hole Login').first().json.session.sid }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "allowUnauthorizedCerts": true,
          "timeout": 600000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "text"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Pi-hole Logout",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1930,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "DELETE",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').first().json.piholeUrl }}/api/auth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "X-FTL-SID",
              "value": "={{ $('Pi-hole Login').first().json.session.sid }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "allowUnauthorizedCerts": true,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "name": "Notify Discord",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.discord",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        2170,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "webhook",
        "content": "=🛡️ Pi-hole blocklist sync done — added {{ $('Summarize').first().json.added }}, already present {{ $('Summarize').first().json.existing }}, failed {{ $('Summarize').first().json.failed }}. Gravity updated.",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Note c039",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        200,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## What changed\nPi-hole lists are added by **URL** (adlist) then gravity is rebuilt — the old version tried to stuff the whole file into a query string.\n\n## Setup\n1. **Config** `blocklists`: one URL per line.\n2. **Config**: `piholeUrl` (e.g. `http://pi.hole`), `piholePassword` (create an *app password* in Pi-hole → Settings → Web interface/API).\nTargets the **Pi-hole v6 REST API** (`/admin/api.php` from v5 no longer exists).\n3. **Notify Discord**: Discord Webhook credential.",
        "width": 2160,
        "height": 340,
        "color": 4
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Sunday 04:00": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Config",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Config": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Pi-hole Login",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Pi-hole Login": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Split Lists",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Split Lists": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Add Blocklist",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Add Blocklist": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Summarize",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Summarize": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Run Gravity",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Run Gravity": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Pi-hole Logout",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Pi-hole Logout": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Notify Discord",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  }
}
